# Repository-root build context: only the dbt runner image (dbt/Dockerfile) uses it. The other images
# (simulator/, loaders/crm/) have their own context and their own ignore files.
*
!dbt
!orchestration/publish
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
dbt/target
dbt/logs
dbt/dbt_packages
dbt/.env
orchestration/publish/tests
